WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:05.280
If I'm in project mode, I might as well 
clarify some things that are out there

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.300
that I really need to get off my chest 
and it starts with this:

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.820
I respect you. I respect you. I respect you.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.340
So many of you. So many of you have 
different opinions than I do.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.240
Disagree with me. Comment.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.740
Leave your three cents, talk behind my back,

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:25.580
and I want you to know, so there is 
NEVER any confusion

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.120
that I respect where you're coming from,

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:31.420
you come from a different place with different circumstances and different narratives.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:34.380
And I will respect it till the end. I really will.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:40.060
As long as your points of view are 
coming from a place of positivity,

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:42.120
added value, debate

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:45.320
intellectual curiosity -

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.000
I will respect you to no end.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.380
And even for the people that are adding their two cents 
to the conversation of MY life...

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:05.940
Maybe I'll save my framework of not leaving two cents

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:09.100
on your life, but if I don't there you go.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.991
Even for the people that have taken the time

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.020
to add their two cents on my life

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.440
out of a place of weakness and despair,

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:20.560
a need to get a short dose of happiness

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:24.860
and the spitting of their negativity on my framework

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:31.812
disguised as constructive criticism 
or lack of kool-aid drinking.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:34.560
I respect it. I understand it.

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:40.400
And I deploy unbelievable amounts 
of gratitude for my parents

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:43.440
and my neighborhoods

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.020
and my homies

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:51.600
And my early grit and grind that 
created the foundation of my life.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:56.940
I respect it. Respect it. Respect it. Speak your truths.

